  "solution": "Concept Used: \n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n157over10 + 31over5 of [5(1)/(8)-(2(1)/(4)+(5)/(3)×(15)/(14)÷(10)/(9) of (3)/(14))]\n\n⇒ 157/10 + 16/5 of [41/8 – (9/4 + 5/3 × 15/14 ÷ 10/9 of 3/14)\n\n⇒ 157/10 + 16/5 of [41/8 – (9/4 + 5/3 × 15/14 ÷ 5/21)\n\n⇒ 157/10 + 16/5 of [41/8 – (9/4 + 5/3 × 15/14 × 21/5)\n\n⇒ 157/10 + 16/5 of [41/8 – (9/4 + 15/2)\n\n⇒ 157/10 + 16/5 of [41/8 – 39/4]\n\n⇒ 157/10 + 16/5 of (-37/8)\n\n⇒ 157/10 + (-74/5)\n\n⇒ 157/10 – 74/5\n\n⇒ (157 – 148)/10\n\n⇒ 9/10\n\n**∴ The required value is 9/10**",
